[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3337484987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110900#issuecomment-3337484987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110900","id":3337484987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G7fq7","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T09:03:10Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T09:04:19Z","body":"This is what it is meant to do according to the documentation:\n> Register a reference for \"do\" that will be erased if the \"do\" history is lost. This is useful mostly for new nodes created for the \"do\" call. Do not use for resources.\n\nAnd in more detail from `UndoRedo`:\n> Register a reference to an object that will be erased if the \"do\" history is deleted. This is useful for objects added by the \"do\" action and removed by the \"undo\" action.\n> \n> When the \"do\" history is deleted, if the object is a RefCounted, it will be unreferenced. Otherwise, it will be freed. Do not use for resources.\n\nYou don't need to add the node as a do reference unless you explicitly want it to be deleted like this","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3337484987/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3426631000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110900#issuecomment-3426631000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110900","id":3426631000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MPj1Y","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T13:23:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T13:23:13Z","body":"Closing due to lack of response, given the documentation this is intended behavior, not a bug\n\nIf you have any updates or more information to indicate this is a bug please comment and this can be reopened ","author_association"